# Required on Vercel. Connect Redis through Project -> Storage -> Create Database.
# This is a SERVER-ONLY native Redis TCP/TLS URL, not an Upstash REST URL.
# Vercel's Redis integration injects REDIS_URL automatically.
# Match the database region to the function region (Frankfurt/fra1).
# REDIS_URL=rediss://default:password@your-redis-host:6379

# Never prefix this secret with VITE_. Never commit a real .env file.
# Local npm run dev uses one in-memory server when REDIS_URL is absent.
# Production deliberately refuses multiplayer without shared Redis.
